            <subfield code="a">Sefer Mishnah berurah /</subfield>
            <subfield code="c">mi-marana ṿe-rabana ha-gaʼon Rabi Yiśraʼel Meʼir ha-Kohen, zatsal, baʻal ha-'Ḥafets Ḥayim'. Mahadurat Or ha-mizraḥ : kinus shiṭot gedole ha-posḳim geʼone Sefarad asher hosifu ʻal divre ha-Mishna. b. o hikhriʻu be-shoneh mi-daʻato ʻim pisḳehem be-nidonim ha-metsuyim bi-zemanenu. La-ruts oraḥ : mafteaḥ meforaṭ le-divre ha-Shulḥan ʻarukh, Beʼer heṭev, ṿe-Shaʻare teshuvah, Mishnah berurah, Beʼur halakhah, ṿe-Shaʻar ha-tsiyon.</subfield>
